[
  {
    "lesson": 1,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.98,
    "bytes": 191425,
    "sha256": "4a36443f458d493aee6a85a2cdcf931551ff568fde1b348ed22ec4f62d66f559",
    "provenance": "Existing lesson 1 recording reused unchanged"
  },
  {
    "lesson": 1,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 8.54,
    "bytes": 273345,
    "sha256": "7a1ef056a7df8d7863bc7cbd6d397e2ae30dd7b94cd2276638ef08a3325d0938",
    "provenance": "Existing lesson 1 recording reused unchanged"
  },
  {
    "lesson": 2,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.81,
    "bytes": 58035,
    "sha256": "7785abe824a3b74cc267fcc7b695763e91ef070dbbb45617e394fd09d0ce2970",
    "text": "한래서왕. 추수동장. 윤여성세. 율려조양.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 2,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.94,
    "bytes": 59603,
    "sha256": "d7718affc786d2930276cee48e40dd7243c86214f7d917a0c7618ac7a2e36059",
    "text": "寒来暑往，秋收冬藏。闰余成岁，律吕条阳。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 3,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.86,
    "bytes": 58662,
    "sha256": "c684785cb817cbd70fb84fa93587706f688d64e3102d1337036230ff751672af",
    "text": "운등치우. 노결위상. 금생여수. 옥출곤강.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 3,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.78,
    "bytes": 57722,
    "sha256": "496783a5f45b968c9651538ac602515c19a45efee4d36d22d85a28a286a88f9d",
    "text": "云腾致雨，露结维霜，金生力水，玉出昆冈。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 4,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.47,
    "bytes": 53960,
    "sha256": "2c85d8907cd459e4043f59cb632e9661fe1ad2a44c930507d9225bcada729adb",
    "text": "검호거궐. 주칭야광. 과진이내. 채중개강.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 4,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.26,
    "bytes": 51453,
    "sha256": "0971ef7d7471d86d473c559592be726c1fc21c4a4a0fbac5da35efab313a1bd7",
    "text": "剑号巨确，珠称夜光，果珍李柰，菜重芥姜。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 5,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "e1684574f5084385a8bdb01cec2670f4f7162cf604c6e26c06e9cf2d65e49852",
    "text": "해함하담. 인잠우상. 용사화제. 조관인황.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 5,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.38,
    "bytes": 64932,
    "sha256": "9dfc5b0a98f487496e1405c3d9fb410c626402474307732ed53bfb842b8b2dee",
    "text": "海咸河淡，鳞潜羽翔，龙师火帝，鸟官人皇。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 6,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.86,
    "bytes": 58662,
    "sha256": "0dae0bb182fe13910122007f94a8ca3b50c5d1507ccfeadb934dd57d130f15b0",
    "text": "시제문자. 내복의상. 추위양국. 유우도당.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 6,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.25,
    "bytes": 63364,
    "sha256": "59dac8e8b1b1f7c160724c05f1552a15c5c7cab2cced1c739d64f82a8a863e70",
    "text": "始制文字，乃服衣常，推位让国，有虞陶唐。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 7,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.44,
    "bytes": 53647,
    "sha256": "18bbd007fed68ded3b27f4987ac2288978688b356dd621a4797a660f5eb8dce2",
    "text": "조민벌죄. 주발은탕. 좌조문도. 수공평장.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 7,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.07,
    "bytes": 61170,
    "sha256": "f2fa42ec3ad09608a5cb88b1363ee255f3802bfc4c4b4db3118cbb4b6164b3b3",
    "text": "吊民伐罪，周发殷汤，坐朝问道，垂拱平章。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 8,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.91,
    "bytes": 59289,
    "sha256": "a00202ac2475bc03b9d56f4361098761118d37228263e753f4060da016b4f6b7",
    "text": "애육여수. 신복융강. 하이일체. 솔빈귀왕.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 8,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.3,
    "bytes": 63991,
    "sha256": "2e4bb3d41323797dfb662672bfa68c5273f8551189b4a40500c772810e9a9c6a",
    "text": "爱育黎首，臣伏戎羌，遐迩壹体，帅宾归王。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 9,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "f0fb45159799a764b05b3d77571782c7c35d5252e35b9a8d81b98d7ef7617ec7",
    "text": "명봉재수. 백구식장. 화피초목. 뇌급만방.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 9,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.59,
    "bytes": 67439,
    "sha256": "798c3c4c868fbd965261488d1c26f99710844fc0fe0a58dee3835ca4a3419c72",
    "text": "鸣凤在树，白驹食场，化披草木，赖及万方。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 10,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "44453c693c562f713a79ce9a2a838672bd8dbf25c42633e579c1de52f1a9a9a3",
    "text": "개차신발. 사대오상. 공유국양. 기감훼상.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 10,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.33,
    "bytes": 64305,
    "sha256": "a822c05e8573ab6dd7ec765dc8a84a3de53f8fc1cadd71a9ea1d255190c7b020",
    "text": "盖此身珐，四大五常，恭惟鞠养，岂敢毁伤。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 11,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.31,
    "bytes": 52079,
    "sha256": "3b266c13cb66acdf4b1e4aa88ba44cba1bd2e7e3e89145a01b91d806b5d30c9d",
    "text": "여모정렬. 남효재량. 지과필개. 득능막망.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 11,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.07,
    "bytes": 61170,
    "sha256": "0498059ff1d3e3067a2d2ee12b38ee4d97ceaa35a845420f8b74b65634b124eb",
    "text": "女慕贞烈，男效才良，知过必改，得能莫忘。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 12,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.73,
    "bytes": 57095,
    "sha256": "dc3785a59391caa73bd865ad3a18814b9b538e9e7e9fe0a3cbb2ef9b329920f4",
    "text": "망담피단. 미시기장. 신사가복. 기욕난량.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 12,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.38,
    "bytes": 64932,
    "sha256": "4e13aefb54dd2cb03848345a71d7182153e4e9eedab0355fee3a351fc924628b",
    "text": "罔谈彼短，米恃己常，信使可覆，器欲难良。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 13,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "f25bd1bc6f6fdc55e9fded4479c03a0d57c0ad9b06c1b58cff19e4bfeb706c68",
    "text": "묵비사염. 시찬고양. 경행유현. 극념작성.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 13,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.54,
    "bytes": 66813,
    "sha256": "1a282a0d7b161c26cb678e79029fdc583ef2522cf1a4a319f5d83b239d204313",
    "text": "墨悲丝染，诗赞羔羊，景行维贤，克念作圣。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 14,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.04,
    "bytes": 60857,
    "sha256": "ba88ce65b529fbe08816587248b722b7ca0fd16575718a86588d138f33ff464f",
    "text": "덕건명립. 형단표정. 공곡전성. 허당습청.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 14,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.81,
    "bytes": 58035,
    "sha256": "64fb55421f9e405363caf04d712c0b210b76747f8b4a8952a1be2c181a2d9afc",
    "text": "德建名立，形端表正，空谷传声，虚堂习听。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 15,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.39,
    "bytes": 53020,
    "sha256": "ac292dd6fbea6bd02103162e3732a6cf9040446236e6d2072379b3b503700d00",
    "text": "화인악적. 복연선경. 척벽비보. 촌음시경.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 15,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.85,
    "bytes": 70574,
    "sha256": "22e71f77b7c1042866cdcaaac3e3d89fc560d1eb065f11897e379cff5026fcbf",
    "text": "祸因恶积，福缘善庆，尺璧非宝，寸阴是竞。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 16,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 6.01,
    "bytes": 72455,
    "sha256": "2cebc0b27d50351586e9f1e515a110523217db136e87d8c9baee7cb26c507cb9",
    "text": "자부사군. 왈엄여경. 효당갈력. 충즉진명.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 16,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "cbe12920eff71658b0e1c6f93d082a02ffd6d5ed7a51a086e5203a9e1a042fe9",
    "text": "资父事君，曰严与敬，孝当竭力，忠则进命。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 17,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.86,
    "bytes": 58662,
    "sha256": "c2672f41c15b6a00a1c947751ceea1d290d6168faaf0a425d15879d149d86302",
    "text": "임심리박. 숙흥온정. 사란사형. 여송지성.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 17,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.81,
    "bytes": 58035,
    "sha256": "a8a50f6baac35c75a2f3ad07813c34a74a30bfdd76802f1f1a92d05a19e39b68",
    "text": "临深履薄，夙兴温凊，四兰斯馨，如松之盛。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 18,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.2,
    "bytes": 62737,
    "sha256": "3807689255455fda46136e716a3991bd001a9604f2bab8e282f42143eb8e6c41",
    "text": "천류불식. 연징취영. 용지약사. 언사안정.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 18,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 6.61,
    "bytes": 79665,
    "sha256": "2b782cb79471a1f6bd61e10c4ba7ebbf627b12e0fd6cbe08d2120a5097ba68ff",
    "text": "川流不息，渊澄取映，容止若思，言辞安定。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 19,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.65,
    "bytes": 56155,
    "sha256": "ff1fad99f8f34a92231d19bba7f475ca6294dc307048416caaf1fcaffb001ab9",
    "text": "독초성미. 신종의령. 영업소기. 적심무경.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 19,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "c53b634469e0f437959f4a4f8f06f93222411656dd31903c914e492054469767",
    "text": "笃初诚美，愼终宜令，荣业所基，籍甚无竟。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 20,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.25,
    "bytes": 63364,
    "sha256": "bfc8614cf43c25819186f9bc76af3ef8ab6d06dbdd7242434604ad1c2280bf7c",
    "text": "학우등사. 섭직종정. 존이감당. 거이익영.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 20,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.78,
    "bytes": 57722,
    "sha256": "1cb965e1449d5e385f0e0cc4db36f14d8ac0aead3fc22eabef64b567bf8cdabe",
    "text": "学优登仕，摄职从政，存以甘棠，去而益咏。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 21,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.44,
    "bytes": 53647,
    "sha256": "e876a16d31c61477c0d5e910f9005cf4b948d2e0cade841ee7db38da63a4e467",
    "text": "악수귀천. 예별존비. 상화하목. 부창부수.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 21,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.59,
    "bytes": 67439,
    "sha256": "e7636cf07603aa0ed403f1349223b0bddeb84ca3563982b16b23915b6dd2b0a8",
    "text": "月殊贵贱，礼别尊卑，上和下睦，夫唱妇随。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 22,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.36,
    "bytes": 52706,
    "sha256": "49e1b3ec2db828d5089130b221bc4dbf65f8b38b837330b0a023574cd874e195",
    "text": "외수부훈. 입봉모의. 제고백숙. 유자비아.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 22,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.94,
    "bytes": 59603,
    "sha256": "94d9919de7b556e1737f3feaaf1b56fb71bbb0bd2db2a1adca4ebbd26ca4bb76",
    "text": "外受傅训，入奉母仪，诸姑伯叔，犹子比儿。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 23,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.07,
    "bytes": 61170,
    "sha256": "b96f9e779a571782c96853fe871e664211e1a8614e9ea53f5ded4cef8506af6f",
    "text": "공회형제. 동기연지. 교우투분. 절마잠규.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 23,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.04,
    "bytes": 60857,
    "sha256": "c1ff104f4cb65271ab10b435931e73c3d42c66b67aa46e06b31bda033f40fff6",
    "text": "孔怀兄弟，同气连枝，交友投份，切磨箴规。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 24,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.44,
    "bytes": 53647,
    "sha256": "f03fb72273add1546a19ecfbd8f4ae5b21b6142f84b7b0a7e220c4ef28b3b2e2",
    "text": "인자은측. 조차불리. 절의염퇴. 전패비휴.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 24,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.68,
    "bytes": 56468,
    "sha256": "2b99c1683f023b2e7957cfe9094b912dbd17b77a3939e0fd49c2ee55bd269d69",
    "text": "仁慈隐恻，造次弗离，节义廉退，顚沛匪亏。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 25,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.57,
    "bytes": 55214,
    "sha256": "75e33e5457c4852c29657175bf79e3c821a06281a38c3e7c51a66bc916354801",
    "text": "성정정일. 심동신피. 수진지만. 축물의이.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 25,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.65,
    "bytes": 56155,
    "sha256": "a1ba7e518c4331e573e5b32db0ce92f88c884d35eae44e885492200e23d00982",
    "text": "性静情逸，心动神疲，守真志满，逐物意移。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 26,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "48e6310e54b62d59973d8f2c56f8ff747d81b5c085f8af2c0990235f765d7352",
    "text": "견지아조. 호작자미. 도읍화하. 동서이경.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 26,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "1efc502eb045656e48579e131a5a76b698c6def4336a497feba057a09c2fd60b",
    "text": "坚持雅操，好爵自縻，督邑华夏，东西二京。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 27,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.78,
    "bytes": 57722,
    "sha256": "1f849285eaf3e984b00f5df419484826d6749cf7ddc36204a66bb7adf9f2d64a",
    "text": "배망면락. 부위거경. 궁전반울. 누관비경.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 27,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.86,
    "bytes": 58662,
    "sha256": "e5dc66b28ac80c9f25d714ff37c1ced143342a591f06aa43d6efa01a3c68deac",
    "text": "背邙面洛，浮渭据泾，宫殿盘郁，楼观飞惊。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 28,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.78,
    "bytes": 57722,
    "sha256": "42aa274ed9cba4bd32bcadee6323441aa004e275ab66852696e5f4c99416ae85",
    "text": "도사금수. 화채선령. 병사방계. 갑장대영.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 28,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "5a1efb798456e00b2335283276b414237001297d5a2539c22a6549553ae39cb6",
    "text": "图写禽兽，画彩仙灵，丙社傍启，甲帐对楹。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 29,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.07,
    "bytes": 61170,
    "sha256": "92ad621e77cdc010393c57ccc55d13ceb515e35ba5086e471298a9a8120eb651",
    "text": "사연설석. 고슬취생. 승계납폐. 변전의성.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 29,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.91,
    "bytes": 59289,
    "sha256": "b4320749ed279d6787c3829f70fcb1e33f785b91b7da83fc660d4833fa53accc",
    "text": "肆筵设席，鼓瑟吹笙，升阶纳陛，弁转疑星。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 30,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.62,
    "bytes": 67753,
    "sha256": "005dbbb8fd818648d973c83af27d804400a3306c1aed0ee425e6e905bb3bf765",
    "text": "우통광내. 좌달승명. 기집분전. 역취군영.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 30,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.65,
    "bytes": 56155,
    "sha256": "825452e6a04bb320f1817cd313c6d8bcac02302a1d5f87b024569130d2cf98a4",
    "text": "右通广内，左达承明，既集坟典，亦聚群英。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 31,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 6.27,
    "bytes": 75590,
    "sha256": "a2583615d3c22a155529f8b586e6e323852f5a6732720ec7217475e5f1fba454",
    "text": "두고종례. 칠서벽경. 부라장상. 노협괴경.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 31,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.41,
    "bytes": 65245,
    "sha256": "3db53fd390a58c3fe8151a3971df6bb42a87efaea6f815017d632701a982fa8b",
    "text": "杜稿钟隶，漆书壁经，府罗将相，路侠槐卿。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 32,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.52,
    "bytes": 54587,
    "sha256": "827ee7a22dfc703d583884a08ba7b9f182db8248b1643ce77366f0ea8d22c8bf",
    "text": "호봉팔현. 가급천병. 고관배련. 구곡진영.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 32,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.91,
    "bytes": 59289,
    "sha256": "4b3fbec4111151e601d4e3cae8c99a3fcf7598d6e0d10d5e4eb367bc242a43a2",
    "text": "户封八县，家己千兵，高冠陪辇，驱毂振缨。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 33,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.38,
    "bytes": 64932,
    "sha256": "40ad5cdb5e3facccf6dd52547c916c813b426471b8d45c47dc86be1c28a9da2c",
    "text": "세록치부. 거가비경. 책공무실. 늑비각명.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 33,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "b5e4186a1aa568ffadc8190fe5cb59fe6007ec995ae462f5c78165d3c2c312e7",
    "text": "世禄侈富，车驾肥轻，策功茂实，乐碑刻铭。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 34,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.59,
    "bytes": 67439,
    "sha256": "b2d5b8aeaabe5228fc56a434c976319f78e90ca108c4143ea844ddb4e8102439",
    "text": "반계이윤. 좌시아형. 엄택곡부. 미단숙영.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 34,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.41,
    "bytes": 65245,
    "sha256": "6796fba4d4be1c25db35e43ce8bd41eda3ed5c5b4b84eaf6b9f4cb6efb9d0763",
    "text": "磻溪伊尹，佐时阿衡，奄宅曲阜，微旦孰营。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 35,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.91,
    "bytes": 59289,
    "sha256": "9650655cc86527f998e4e3c4348c26f10e11217a251c0716f65f095a1a3be49b",
    "text": "환공광합. 제약부경. 기회한혜. 설감무정.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 35,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.78,
    "bytes": 57722,
    "sha256": "0e14c590a03f3741da41837319cf9cf77a5b4b5d84a9f896d4f48ef0f0b7aa72",
    "text": "桓公匡合，济弱扶倾，绮回汉惠，悦感武丁。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 36,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.73,
    "bytes": 57095,
    "sha256": "fef490b98ba493443cf802cc2f4aa0372d2a098af603e3ab78bad0f4d8cc447a",
    "text": "준예밀물. 다사식녕. 진초갱패. 조위곤횡.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 36,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.59,
    "bytes": 67439,
    "sha256": "e84ed47619590dcb109d4af35ec69a62c5e2269693e5f5ff2f498ed840411adc",
    "text": "俊乂密勿，多士寔宁，晋楚耕霸，赵魏困横。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 37,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.41,
    "bytes": 65245,
    "sha256": "141739810eddd2ec833ac842122d75fab42d122a679e066145f2b5e90d242c3e",
    "text": "가도멸괵. 천토회맹. 하준약법. 한폐번형.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 37,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "52bc0b9600d17a41acaa405bff5e4f967b3b62cd46a6396d5cffbe099442d57c",
    "text": "假途灭虢，践土会盟，何遵约法，韩弊烦刑。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 38,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.73,
    "bytes": 57095,
    "sha256": "36cd9d8459b501dc6a757ebd9fc64e85ffbd262773ab598857bbffbe8d8bc8e7",
    "text": "기전파목. 용군최정. 선위사막. 치예단청.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 38,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.65,
    "bytes": 56155,
    "sha256": "d0517ba6ef46541253b90e9df6917918e40f4c7c71daf4690e20e8f5ee069379",
    "text": "起翦坡牧，用军最精，宣威沙漠，驰誉丹靑。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 39,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.33,
    "bytes": 64305,
    "sha256": "a38ac05f4d5409f353552480fa75cbf287f9936f205efb7a4ca2d2a25417d4a3",
    "text": "구주우적. 백군진병. 악종항대. 선주운정.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 39,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.2,
    "bytes": 62737,
    "sha256": "daf898fa30504c06d2cdd4dced9a5f6e29e7dea87e085fdd878a9555e3ce532a",
    "text": "九州禹迹，百郡秦幷，岳宗恒岱，善主云亭。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 40,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.47,
    "bytes": 53960,
    "sha256": "41a47fa090ba696b7fa02b07e775758fe816c69fd9d6736f2b15744246b2d208",
    "text": "안문자새. 계전적성. 곤지갈석. 거야동정.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 40,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.68,
    "bytes": 56468,
    "sha256": "45fd5c5497c00695e1e9612aec0d6ca0ed673ce92271988543afa095fe524435",
    "text": "雁门紫赛，鸡田赤城，昆池碣石，巨野洞庭。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 41,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.18,
    "bytes": 50512,
    "sha256": "f2fa12195659efc91b42befb702a2020c63a79b6fce00ac20ef967fc080a7fef",
    "text": "광원면막. 암수묘명. 치본어농. 무자가색.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 41,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.6,
    "bytes": 55528,
    "sha256": "ec1a235ce6ad02998b7b9f2aecd7c263f99354bc8b739e279b95cdbf16e1ca45",
    "text": "旷远绵邈，岩岫杳冥，治本于农，务玆稼穑。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 42,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.33,
    "bytes": 64305,
    "sha256": "7a262ba93b58ce508786dd90527711ce93e57828af0a392f5ca29c90a88d9cf8",
    "text": "숙재남묘. 아예서직. 세숙공신. 권상출척.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 42,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.46,
    "bytes": 65872,
    "sha256": "236395fde8f1fff1fdd2d2664e8d08c54c40feed00c0ba7ed81ddc737191dbaf",
    "text": "俶宰南亩，我艺黍稷，税熟贡新，劝赏黜陟。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 43,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "ec864e6c4b19f1d75226c352a2dfdd0a8e521b8d6b59fc66c3ab6dcde57ea2b8",
    "text": "맹가돈소. 사어병직. 서기중용. 노겸근칙.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 43,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.68,
    "bytes": 56468,
    "sha256": "1b1f9cbd9483fcfc004bc93b26bbb934eaa9efb78f01c1f374b549654b374a7d",
    "text": "孟轲敦素，史鱼秉直，庶机中庸，劳谦谨勅。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 44,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.39,
    "bytes": 53020,
    "sha256": "e69335a313c902fa87fccf44202a1f09fbb01b121829e2b6855604a505132456",
    "text": "영음찰리. 감모변색. 이궐가유. 면기지식.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 44,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.51,
    "bytes": 66499,
    "sha256": "0b5d7da93c0908670fd557a69b300dfc8a6ad148ba86327b6ebacc94d7281b4a",
    "text": "聆音察理，鉴貌辨色，贻厥嘉猷，勉其祗植。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 45,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.75,
    "bytes": 69320,
    "sha256": "2c5f054079429155db5639d08b46e34f2245e40e90b0ac1ffe5f7115181e7cea",
    "text": "성궁기계. 총증항극. 태욕근치. 임고행즉.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 45,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "33d7957fa7d5286c74cf8b73e4046cdfe454a6e4c80588e2011bed16e2dd565e",
    "text": "醒躬讥诫，宠增抗极，殆辱近耻，林皐幸即。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 46,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.86,
    "bytes": 58662,
    "sha256": "cae98b6c56b64d3e59454ccab1a9395374ee1f3ec2d26a731733cd957f88d648",
    "text": "양소견기. 해조수핍. 색거한처. 침묵적요.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 46,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.72,
    "bytes": 69007,
    "sha256": "a2a1456a7566242cd22cf6caf48203897f28b02914059d3f2f641e69b998cd6b",
    "text": "两疏见机，解组谁逼，索居闲楚，沉默寂寥。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 47,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.73,
    "bytes": 57095,
    "sha256": "a08d3981473fca3c0d7d1866e356c751cb98560f446d0ad56f2603b3baff9258",
    "text": "구고심론. 산려소요. 흔주루견. 척사환초.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 47,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.73,
    "bytes": 57095,
    "sha256": "ef4e40e9d2f2dab058c6af3a806cb69616ea0deec0361f09295496ec4e361984",
    "text": "求古寻论，散虑逍遥，欣奏泪遣，戚谢欢招。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 48,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.3,
    "bytes": 63991,
    "sha256": "165a77c5c08b552aec86a727a382684d648a3968e4e991b60595700f61074a70",
    "text": "거하적력. 원망추조. 비파만취. 오동조조.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 48,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.62,
    "bytes": 67753,
    "sha256": "2c21961ce4ea128dadaf3f5158186657afeeba26c3ca5eb99593fbd73ddea1d4",
    "text": "渠荷帝历，园莽抽条，枇杷晩翠，梧桐早凋。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 49,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.86,
    "bytes": 58662,
    "sha256": "18879f84f36482c295decb1e2908154245c7cfb6013820888962e3de04dd8914",
    "text": "진근위예. 낙엽표요. 유곤독운. 능마강소.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 49,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.81,
    "bytes": 58035,
    "sha256": "7d3ec209ccf73aa02c5004da6bcf29a606c22a9a28fb3b42a79f1edb66cf02e4",
    "text": "陈根委翳，落叶飘飖，游鹍独运，凌摩绛霄。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 50,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "fabb618b26e7ef007f8bb276737995163b228ea7e6bf4d138825fc678e2ee971",
    "text": "탐독완시. 우목낭상. 이유유외. 속이원장.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 50,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.91,
    "bytes": 59289,
    "sha256": "3d99c9f127e377e49af400c97c8fff456e1e22e10674630fa5c9e3c5b356b254",
    "text": "耽读玩市，寓目囊箱，易𬨎攸畏，主耳垣墙。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 51,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.73,
    "bytes": 57095,
    "sha256": "67847a69ce81da792699ac16671978d8ddd0d22e7d61248c055879420b0e1473",
    "text": "구선손반. 적구충장. 포어팽재. 기염조강.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 51,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.04,
    "bytes": 60857,
    "sha256": "4bc2ff4ea0ed548b9c42923d3db69bbdb616c5e32b4267f0cc1968f6fb533661",
    "text": "具膳飡饭，适口充肠，饱饫烹宰，饥厌糟糠。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 52,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.52,
    "bytes": 54587,
    "sha256": "9ff59a802bec0c9a78a70800ef8b966b5919f00f010cb7d554a9fb1657787b2b",
    "text": "친척고구. 노소이량. 첩어적방. 시건유방.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 52,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.04,
    "bytes": 60857,
    "sha256": "2cb2e5e51b9914440ac481906f395a6b5a014e9d700ae36d463ed85c6a76026c",
    "text": "亲戚故旧，老绍异粮，妾御绩纺，侍巾帷房。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 53,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.75,
    "bytes": 69320,
    "sha256": "84d9572c56ce89d2b5dc2b53092c133b96c624cd977f661cc1d595c8b7b48b7e",
    "text": "환선원결. 은촉위황. 주면석매. 남순상상.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 53,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.12,
    "bytes": 61797,
    "sha256": "1a589f2eaed603de24c0fcdbf5c2d05eb8b641a42c71022c15e424cbbeeaec73",
    "text": "纨扇圆洁，银烛炜煌，昼眠夕寐，蓝笋象床。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 54,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.52,
    "bytes": 54587,
    "sha256": "cae2ec40d0f7eb5b5cab159aae0122871e1ead862a6d5aa153fada403df36943",
    "text": "현가주연. 접배거상. 교수돈족. 열예차강.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 54,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "394db9fefbd97cfb1dde05aadbcfd0092c0a7e1d87a56f21455c7b01557be168",
    "text": "弦歌酒䜩，接杯擧觞，矫手顿足，悦豫且康。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 55,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.12,
    "bytes": 61797,
    "sha256": "77eb25965765708ec594237b05664438dec77e669b6b72aeff941c222133f054",
    "text": "적후사속. 제사증상. 계상재배. 송구공황.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 55,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.8,
    "bytes": 69947,
    "sha256": "439d5b794195ee0dedd5c4a221a242bf3d6cb8a032d1e5c4f6003f11be53d137",
    "text": "嫡后嗣续，祭祀烝尝，启颡再拜，悚惧恐惶。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 56,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.91,
    "bytes": 59289,
    "sha256": "b424dfd77fc05d6e635ba7750036209b7b4a12181201eebd4db99039a195a9c8",
    "text": "전첩간요. 고답심상. 해구상욕. 집열원량.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 56,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.68,
    "bytes": 56468,
    "sha256": "619fbf3577b5625c91d55b51ca9f379169412534f26dbfb942f9ddd449975944",
    "text": "牋牒简要，顾答审详，骸垢想浴，执热愿凉。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 57,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.26,
    "bytes": 51453,
    "sha256": "60b4c980f1d58be1d98155bc411d52e53f0798a36d3da7c2df907162ad712df3",
    "text": "여라독특. 해약초양. 주참적도. 포획반망.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 57,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.65,
    "bytes": 56155,
    "sha256": "d407bc95e5bab69dc9473b14e2a8092e12dc057dae94325f12594d237188e1d8",
    "text": "驴骡犊特，骇跃超骧，诛斩贼盗，捕获叛亡。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 58,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.05,
    "bytes": 48945,
    "sha256": "3e6510447d71bdf956d4349910f2cab44515a025bc32ee35d09ee80536246b25",
    "text": "포사료환. 혜금완소. 염필윤지. 균교임조.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 58,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.88,
    "bytes": 70888,
    "sha256": "4372911e7a06395425cde5203c20978f5b9142cccdd19bb8449755911f0253c6",
    "text": "布射辽丸，嵇琴阮啸，恬笔伦纸，钧巧仁钓。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 59,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.41,
    "bytes": 65245,
    "sha256": "3a35f45818f5df65cdbc489647c096cbe90e7d269862fe3cfef28c7502ab2b0d",
    "text": "석분리속. 병개가묘. 모시숙자. 공빈연소.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 59,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.12,
    "bytes": 61797,
    "sha256": "ddb7705565b4aaa45c6254daac1ce90885b00601dd99029a7734c3af4f50abd5",
    "text": "释纷利俗，竝皆佳妙，毛施淑姿，工颦姸笑。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 60,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 5.2,
    "bytes": 62737,
    "sha256": "b0417712e6ff1d3f1ddb6436a426373be01cf762caed2cbc0e91f343383aa4e3",
    "text": "연시매최. 희휘낭요. 선기현알. 회백환조.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 60,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 4.91,
    "bytes": 59289,
    "sha256": "7fb16f75345f6b9601fc2e779b10429dcd3e72a426c6f948e68ae61267192167",
    "text": "年矢每催，曦晖朗耀，璇玑悬斡，晦魄环照。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 61,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.86,
    "bytes": 58662,
    "sha256": "839314b58a0205e6f23b3244deecf25ff568a90bc4bf07e0e218ee8fb71311b8",
    "text": "지신수우. 영수길소. 구보인령. 부앙낭묘.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 61,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.17,
    "bytes": 62424,
    "sha256": "87f00c79fc565cfd4cd1497babafa1f9a2a71a975679b1d9063ddb37f1277ab3",
    "text": "指薪修祐，永绥吉劭，矩步引领，俯仰廊庙。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 62,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 4.99,
    "bytes": 60230,
    "sha256": "454adca1c1c67988dca8227c50cf19efff9b5ed4a152b2060473de89fc84abe0",
    "text": "속대긍장. 배회첨조. 고루과문. 우몽등초.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 62,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 5.07,
    "bytes": 61170,
    "sha256": "114aefe197c2375c57d5a713870be428d3cf59f6b4b8fa2e4029e85eaef8d32d",
    "text": "束带矜庄，徘徊瞻眺，孤陋寡闻，愚蒙等诮。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 63,
    "language": "ko",
    "duration_seconds": 2.3,
    "bytes": 27942,
    "sha256": "666cdeb40614ec30f226ece938174dd2c9cff6e77eecdec7d25401707b726be3",
    "text": "위어조자. 언재호야.",
    "voice_id": "fe3fbd12d84c41b5a791e6ea544f774d",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  },
  {
    "lesson": 63,
    "language": "zh",
    "duration_seconds": 2.43,
    "bytes": 29510,
    "sha256": "31aea2d518ebff3913dcb94fd86e8967e6421eb4e8eb6d3bd4a07d4adacef63d",
    "text": "谓语助者，焉哉乎也。",
    "voice_id": "6c364011f30747c9a0a89eec3787cadc",
    "engine": "starfish",
    "timestamp_check": true
  }
]